We have our first dive at Milln Reef before moving to Flynn Reef for the remaining three. These clips are the culminations of all the dives of the day including the night dive at the end. The visibility is something to behold in the outer reef of the Great Barrier Reef. It was genuinely breathtaking some of the encounters we were able to see today.

## Dive stats

- **Location:** Flynn Reef, QLD
- **Date:** 21 June 2026
- **Depth:** 14.2m avg, 22m max
- **Visibility:** 12-20m

## Highlights

Humphead Parrotfish, Turtles, Maori Wrasse, Barracuda, Lobster, and Rays
